  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A contract for a certain service requires a onetime activation cost of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"dollar sign 35\"><mo>$</mo><mn>35</mn></math> and a monthly cost of <math alttext=\"dollar sign 23\"><mo>$</mo><mn>23</mn></math>. Which equation represents this situation, where <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> is the total cost, in dollars, of this service contract for <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> months?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
